_PROVIDER_INTERFACE.md"}]},{"id":"blk-50746","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79425","text":"Checklist:"}]},{"id":"blk-50747","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50749","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79426","text":"[ ] Data plane executes customer agent code; control plane never does."}]}],"id":"blk-50748","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50751","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79427","text":"[ ] Control plane stores metadata/config and orchestrates deploy/invoke/billing only."}]}],"id":"blk-50750","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50753","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79428","text":"[ ] No control-plane endpoint directly runs untrusted bundles."}]}],"id":"blk-50752","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-50754","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79429","text":"Done when:"}]},{"id":"blk-50755","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50757","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79430","text":"A code review can point to one “data plane entrypoint contract” per provider and confirm control-plane code does not execute customer code."}]}],"id":"blk-50756","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-50758","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-79431","text":"2) Identity model and tenancy (user-scoped v1)"}]},{"id":"blk-50759","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79432","marks":["bold"],"text":"Spec sources:"},{"id":"spn-79433","text":" "},{"id":"spn-79434","marks":["code"],"text":"30_DATA_MODEL_CONVEX.md"},{"id":"spn-79435","text":", "},{"id":"spn-79436","marks":["code"],"text":"10_API_CONTRACTS.md"}]},{"id":"blk-50760","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79437","text":"Checklist:"}]},{"id":"blk-50761","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-50763","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-79438","text":"[ ] One canonical mapping from auth provider identity → internal "},{"id":"spn-79439","marks":["code"],"text":"users"},{"id":"spn-79440","text":" row."}]}],"id":"blk-50762","kind":"list-item"